WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
An agent’s first day.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:08.000
Find a case with removable earbuds. Found: four parts, a hinged lid and source video.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
First, understand the object: its parts, connection and evidence.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Then prototype the task: open the case and move the earbuds.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.500
Release both earbuds on their targets. Close the case and withdraw.

6
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Models, program and evidence, together.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Interaction Twin. Show it once. Keep how it works.

